  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>QueriesProcessingGroup</name>
    <id>251</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>QueriesProcessingHeaderDecoration</name>
      <id>246</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>To continue the performed operation, it is required to allow the application to use external resources. 
To allow the application to use external resources, click the &lt;link internal://sm>hyperlink&lt;/> to go to the personal account. 

When you allow using external resources, the operation will continue automatically.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>برای ادامه عملیات در حال انجام، باید به برنامه اجازه استفاده از منابع خارجی داده شود. 
برای اعطای اجازه استفاده از منابع خارجی به برنامه، روی &lt;link internal://sm>ابرپیوند&lt;/> کلیک کنید تا به حساب شخصی بروید. 

پس از اعطای اجازه استفاده از منابع خارجی، عملیات به‌طور خودکار ادامه خواهد یافت.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Для продолжения выполняемой операции требуется разрешить для программы использование внешних ресурсов.
Для того, чтобы разрешить использование внешних ресурсов, перейдите в личный кабинет по &lt;link internal://sm>гиперссылке&lt;/>.

После того, как Вы разрешите использование внешних ресурсов, выполнение операции продолжится автоматически.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>İşleme devam etmek için uygulamanın harici kaynakları kullanmasına izin vermeniz gerekir.
Harici kaynakların kullanımına izin vermek için &lt;link internal://sm>bağlantıyı&lt;/> kullanarak kişisel hesabınıza gidin.

Bundan sonra harici kaynakların kullanılmasına izin verirseniz, işlem otomatik olarak devam edecektir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Để tiếp tục thao tác đang thực hiện, cần cho phép sử dụng nguồn ngoài đối với chương trình. 
Để cho phép sử dụng nguồn ngoài, hãy chuyển đến tài khoản cá nhân theo &lt;link internal://sm>hyperlink&lt;/>.  

Sau khi Bạn cho phép sử dụng nguồn ngoài, sẽ tự động tiếp tục thực hiện thao tác.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>To continue the performed operation, it is required to allow the application to use external resources. 
To allow the application to use external resources, click the &lt;link internal://sm>hyperlink&lt;/> to go to the personal account. 

When you allow using external resources, the operation will continue automatically.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>To continue the performed operation, it is required to allow the application to use external resources. 
To allow the application to use external resources, click the &lt;link internal://sm>hyperlink&lt;/> to go to the personal account. 

When you allow using external resources, the operation will continue automatically.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
